<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US">
  <voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">
    <prosody rate="+2%" pitch="-0.5st">
      Agents can pay in seconds. One mistake becomes real loss.
      <break time="350ms"/>
      Railguard sits between agent and wallet: policy first, reconcile after broadcast, evidence without custody.
      <break time="400ms"/>
      Our Failure Lab simulates six classes&mdash;replay, races, stale auth, settlement mismatch.
      <break time="350ms"/>
      On Arbitrum Sepolia, hook contracts deployed. Separately, zero point zero one USDC verified on-chain and marked settled.
      <break time="400ms"/>
      Proofs are public. Open source, testnet-first, for agents that move money.
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
